why Every Alliance quest of Blackfathom Deeps in one run, lead-in included.

# Blackfathom Deeps' Alliance quests in one guide: the pick-ups in Stormwind,
# Ironforge, Darnassus and Auberdine, one run, then the hand-ins. Steps
# already done are passed over, so the guide picks up wherever the chain
# stands.
#
# The quests: Argos Nightwhisper's 3765 The Corruption Abroad (to Gershala
# Nightwhisper) -> 1275 Researching the Corruption (eight Corrupted Brain
# Stems); Gerrig Bonegrip's 971 Knowledge in the Deeps (the Lorgalis
# Manuscript, from a Pitted Iron Chest inside); Dawnwatcher Shaedlass' 1198 In
# Search of Thaelrid (to Argent Guard Thaelrid inside) -> 1200 Blackfathom
# Villainy (Kelris' head, for Dawnwatcher Selgorm); Argent Guard Manados' 1199
# Twilight Falls (ten Twilight Pendants).
#
# Left out: the Warlocks' 1740 The Orb of Soran'ruk (its large fragment comes
# from Shadowfang Keep); 78916 The Heart of the Void and 908 Amongst the
# Ruins, which have no giver in the data.
#
# Inside: nothing in the data places the bosses, Thaelrid or the chest
# inside, so their goals stand at the door (@14.5,14.2, Ashenvale) with
# `group 5`. The bosses come in the order of the client's dungeon journal
# (Ghamoo-ra, Lady Sarevess, Geilhast, Lorgus Jett, Old Serra'kis, Twilight
# Lord Kelris, Aku'mai), not of a recorded run. Every quest goal is counted by
# the quest log, so a group that takes them in another order still gets each
# step ticked.
#
# Sources (facts only):
# - Quests, NPCs, items, objects and rewards: Polestar's reference data
#   (data/forever, built from QuestieDB Forever 1.1.4) and Polestar 0.4.1.1's
#   Codex page for the dungeon. The brain stems also drop from the naga and
#   satyrs of Darkshore and Ashenvale; lint warns that the door is more than
#   50 yards from those, and the goal stays at the door for the ones inside.
# - The door: players' recordings, as Polestar's Codex holds them
#   (data/codex/entrances.json).
# - The dungeon's size, levels and bosses: the client's group finder and
#   dungeon journal, as Polestar's Codex page holds them (five players, levels
#   24 to 32).
# INGAME: where inside do Argent Guard Thaelrid and the Pitted Iron Chest
#   stand?

step Argos Nightwhisper
  tip In Stormwind.
  accept 3765

step Gerrig Bonegrip
  zone Ironforge
  accept 971

step Dawnwatcher Shaedlass
  zone Darnassus
  accept 1198

step Argent Guard Manados
  accept 1199

step Gershala Nightwhisper
  zone Darkshore
  tip In Auberdine.
  turnin 3765
  accept 1275

step To Blackfathom Deeps
  zone Ashenvale
  tip A dungeon for five players of level 24 to 32.
  enter "Blackfathom Deeps" @14.5,14.2

step Brain stems and pendants
  along until leave
  collect 5952 x8 quest 1275.1 @14.5,14.2 group 5 -- The naga and satyrs inside drop them, Lady Sarevess too.
  collect 5879 x10 quest 1199.1 @14.5,14.2 group 5 -- The Twilight cultists drop them.

step Argent Guard Thaelrid
  tip He waits inside.
  turnin 1198 @14.5,14.2
  accept 1200 @14.5,14.2

step The Lorgalis Manuscript
  tip In a Pitted Iron Chest inside.
  collect 5359 quest 971.1 @14.5,14.2 group 5

step Twilight Lord Kelris
  tip The sixth boss in the client's journal, after Ghamoo-ra, Lady Sarevess, Geilhast, Lorgus Jett and Old Serra'kis; Aku'mai comes last. Kelris' head is for Dawnwatcher Selgorm.
  collect 5881 quest 1200.1 @14.5,14.2 group 5

step Before you leave
  label leave
  tip Whatever is still short of the brain stems and the pendants, finish it before you go.
  collect 5952 x8 quest 1275.1 @14.5,14.2 group 5
  collect 5879 x10 quest 1199.1 @14.5,14.2 group 5

